//RS // ============================================================================
//RS // Section: `pub(package)` visibility (was tests/pub_package.rs)
//RS //
//RS // Uses its own `Scratch` helper rather than the `tmp_dir`/`write` pair above:
//RS // unlike `tmp_dir`, `Scratch` mixes a nanosecond suffix into the dir name (so
//RS // concurrent test runs never collide on a bare label) and cleans up via
//RS // `Drop`. Kept separate rather than forced onto the shared helper.
//RS // ============================================================================
